From 8fddd571ef6d38115d1bc868722ebb0c22b93c37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 00:07:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Bindings: layout of the material data managers

C: mgis_bv_FieldLayout, mgis_bv_material_data_manager_initializer_set_layout,
mgis_bv_material_state_manager_get_layout. Fortran: POINT_BY_POINT and
COMPONENT_BY_COMPONENT, material_data_manager_initializer_set_layout,
material_state_manager_get_layout; the functions returning the arrays of a
material state manager as two-dimensional arrays (one column per point)
report an error for the component by component layout, which they can't
describe. Python: FieldLayout, layout members, numpy arrays with the
strides of the layout (same indices for both layouts), constructor of the
initializer of a material data manager, which could not be built. Tests in
the three languages.
